WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:03.703
NEW DETAILS
ABOUT THE CLASSIFIED MATERIALS

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.705
FOUND AT PRESIDENT BIDEN'S HOME
AND THE FALLOUT.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:08.041
HERE'S WHAT WE KNOW THIS
MORNING.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:11.444
THE WHITE HOUSE CONFIRMS THE
AIDES FOUND FIVE ADDITIONAL

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:16.116
PAGES OF CLASSIFIED MATERIALS ON
THE SAME DAY A SPECIAL COUNSEL

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:17.650
WAS APPOINTED TO INVESTIGATE THE
MATTER.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.087
THAT BRINGS A TOTAL OF DOCUMENTS
RECOVERED TO ABOUT 20.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:24.557
THE WHITE HOUSE COUNCIL'S OFFICE
ANNOUNCING IT WILL NO LONGER

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.392
ANSWER QUESTIONS ABOUT THE
CONTROVERSY BECAUSE OF A SPECIAL

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:31.998
COUNSEL INVESTIGATION UNDER WAY.
PRESIDENT BIDEN'S PERSONAL

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.634
ATTORNEYS SAY THEY HAVE BEEN
TRYING TO BALANCE THE IMPORTANCE

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:39.405
OF PUBLIC TRANSPARENCY WITH
PROTECTING THE INTEGRITY OF THE

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:43.910
INVESTIGATION.
BUT THE PRESIDENT HAS NOT BEEN

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.946
TRANSPARENT ENOUGH FOR JAMES
COMER.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:49.282
HE'S DEMANDING MORE INFORMATION
FROM THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:52.886
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T KNOW EXACTLY YET
WHETHER THEY BROKE THE LAW OR

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.854
NOT.
I WILL ACCUSE THE BIDEN

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.823
ADMINISTRATION OF NOT BEING
TRANSPARENT.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:01:01.060
WHY DIDN'T WE HEAR ABOUT THIS ON
NOVEMBER 2nd WHEN THE FIRST

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.662
BATCH OF CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS
WERE DISCOVERED.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:05.899
&gt;&gt; DEMOCRATS ARE COMING TO
PRESIDENT BIDEN'S DEFENSE

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:10.203
DETERMINED TO HIGHLIGHT THE
DIFFERENCE BETWEEN BIDEN'S

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:12.538
HANDLING OF CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS
AND TRUMP'S.

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:15.141
&gt;&gt; WE WERE DELIGHTED TO LEARN
THAT THE PRESIDENT'S LAWYERS,

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:20.747
THE MOMENT THEY FOUND OUT ABOUT
THE DOCUMENTS THAT DAY TURNED

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:23.383
THEM OVER TO THE NATIONAL
ARCHIVES AND ULTIMATELY TO THE

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:26.186
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE.
THAT IS A VERY DIFFERENT POSTURE

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:27.754
THAN WHAT WE SAW WITH DONALD
TRUMP.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:35.328
&gt;&gt; SO LET'S BRING IN CNN SENIOR
WHITE HOUSE CORRESPONDENT, MJ

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:36.563
LEE.
GOOD MORNING TO YOU.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:39.766
LOOK, THERE IS A DIFFERENCE BUT
IF YOU'RE EXPLAINING, YOU'RE

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.834
LOSING.
BECAUSE OVER THE WEEKEND WE GOT

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:45.271
ANOTHER UPDATE OF MORE DOCUMENTS
BEING FOUND.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.207
WHAT IS GOING ON HERE?
&gt;&gt; Reporter: GOOD MORNING, DON,

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:50.543
YET ANOTHER UPDATE FROM THE
WHITE HOUSE COUNCIL'S OFFICE

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:53.546
OVER THE WEEKEND ABOUT MORE
CLASSIFIED DOCUMENTS THAT WERE

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.481
FOUND THAT WE WEREN'T PREVIOUSLY
AWARE OF.

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:59.786
WE ARE TALKING ABOUT FIVE
ADDITIONAL PAGES OF CLASSIFIED

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.956
DOCUMENTS THAT WERE FOUND AT
PRESIDENT BIDEN'S WILMINGTON

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:08.061
HOME ON THURSDAY NIGHT.
THIS IS ACCORDING TO THE SPECIAL

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:11.864
COUNSEL TO THE PRESIDENT.
HE SAYS HE WENT OVER TO THE

00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:15.134
WILMINGTON HOUSE WITH DOJ
OFFICIALS TO HAND OVER ONE

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:17.203
CLASSIFIED DOCUMENT THAT HAD
BEEN DISCOVERED ON WEDNESDAY AND

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:21.641
IT IS AT THIS POINT THAT THIS
GROUP DISCOVERED THE ADDITIONAL

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:25.845
PAGES WITH CLASSIFIED MARKINGS.
NOW HE SAID THAT THE DOJ

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:29.983
IMMEDIATELY TOOK OVER THOSE
DOCUMENTS AND THAT NOW THAT A

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:32.986
SPECIAL COUNSEL HAS BEEN
APPOINTED TO INVESTIGATE THIS

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:36.222
MATTER, THE WHITE HOUSE
COUNCIL'S OFFICE IS NO LONGER

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.659
GOING TO BE ANSWERING QUESTIONS.
&gt;&gt; AND THE PRESIDENT'S PERSONAL

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:42.228
LAWYER PUT OUT THIS LENGTHY
STATEMENT OVER THE WEEKEND

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:47.033
TRYING TO DEFEND HOW EVERYTHING
HAS BEEN HANDLED SO FAR.

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.469
THAT'S KIND OF TRICKY AGAIN SO
MANY DETAILS.

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:52.338
I'M NOT SURE IF THE AMERICAN
PEOPLE CAN PARSE THE DETAILS.

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:54.707
I'M SURE THEY KNOW THE
DIFFERENCE BUT AT THE END OF THE

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:58.544
DAY, MJ, ONE PERSON HAD
DOCUMENTS THAT WERE MISHANDLES,

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:02.048
ANOTHER PERSON HAD DOCUMENTS
THAT WERE HIS MISHANDLED AND

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:06.819
MAYBE THAT'S HOW THE PUBLIC SEES
IT BUT WHAT ARE THE LAWYERS

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:09.022
SAYING?
&gt;&gt; WE'RE SEEING THE WHITE HOUSE

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:14.360
PLAY DEFENSE RIGHT NOW.
THE PRESIDENT'S PERSONAL LAWYER,

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:17.063
BOB BAUER PUT OUT A LENGTHY
STATEMENT OVER THE WEEKEND

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:19.799
EXPLAINING THE DIFFERENT
PROCESSES THAT THE LAWYERS

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:22.135
AROUND THE PRESIDENT HAVE
FOLLOWED THROUGHOUT THIS PROCESS

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:25.505
AND PARTICULARLY EXPLAINING WHY
LAWYERS COULDN'T REALLY DISCLOSE

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:30.043
ALL OF THE INFORMATION THAT THEY
KNEW AT ANY GIVEN TIME FOR FEAR

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:33.713
OF INTERFERING WITH AN ONGOING
DOJ REVIEW.

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:37.116
I WANT TO READ A KEY PART OF
THAT STATEMENT FROM BOB BAUER

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:40.720
THAT I THINK TRIES TO EXPLAIN A
MAJOR PART OF THIS PROCESS.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:45.325
HE SAYS, BECAUSE PRESIDENT
BIDEN'S PERSONAL LAWYERS DO NOT

00:03:45.325 --> 00:03:50.863
HAVE ACTIVE SECURITY CLEARANCES,
WHENEVER A DOCUMENT BEARING

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:53.399
CLASSIFIED MARKINGS WAS
IDENTIFIED, THE SEARCH WAS

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:56.736
SUSPENDED OF THE BOX, FILE, OR
OTHER SPACE WHERE THE DOCUMENT

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:59.806
WAS DISCOVERED WITH THE
POTENTIALLY CLASSIFIED MATERIAL

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:03.743
LEFT IN THE PLACE AS FOUND.
NOW HE SAYS THE GOVERNMENT WAS

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:07.113
PROMPTLY NOTIFIED.
IT'S FOR THIS REASON THAT THE

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:10.717
PRESIDENT'S PERSONAL ATTORNEYS
DO NOT KNOW THE PRECISE NUMBER

00:04:10.717 --> 00:04:12.985
OF PAGES IN THE DISCOVERED
MATERIAL NOR HAVE THEY REVIEWED

00:04:12.985 --> 00:04:16.255
THE CONTENT OF THE DOCUMENTS
CONSISTENT WITH THE STANDARD

00:04:16.255 --> 00:04:19.492
PROCEDURES AND REQUIREMENTS.
NOW THE WHITE HOUSE HAS FACED A

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:22.929
TON OF QUESTIONS ABOUT BOTH THE
MESSAGING AND THE TRANSPARENCY.

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:27.800
I THINK WHAT WE CAN SAY WITH
CERTAINTY RIGHT NOW IS IT IS

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:32.205
VERY POSSIBLE IN THE COMING DAYS
AND WEEKS WE COULD BE LEARNING

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:33.639
ABOUT ADDITIONAL CLASSIFIED
DOCUMENTS.

00:04:33.639 --> 00:04:40.646
WE JUST DON'T KNOW.
&gt;&gt; MJ LEE AT THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:04:40.646 --> 00:04:47.687
THANK YOU.
&gt;&gt;&gt; LET'S TALK ABOUT THIS WITH

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:49.655
RONALD HEIR.
GOOD MORNING, SIR, THANKS FOR

00:04:49.655 --> 00:04:51.858
JOINING US.
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING, GLAD TO BE

00:04:51.858 --> 00:04:53.960
HERE.
&gt;&gt; WE WERE STRUCK -- THANKS FOR

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:59.732
COMING ON BECAUSE WE WERE STRUCK
BY TWO OP-EDS IN TWO DAYS IN TWO

00:04:59.732 --> 00:05:04.270
DIFFERENT PUBLICATIONS ONE WAS
YOURS IN THE ATLANTIC.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:06.939
THE TITLE IS BIDEN'S CLASSIFIED
DOCUMENTS SHOULD HAVE NO IMPACT

00:05:06.939 --> 00:05:13.780
ON TRUMP'S LEGAL JEOPARDY AND
THIS PIECE IN "THE WASHINGTON

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:23.823
POST."
IF MAR-A-LAGO CASE COLLAPSES,

00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:30.730
A -- DISASTER DODGED, AMERICA.
IT GOES ON TO SAY, ACCORDING TO

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:34.000
THE LATEST DATA, 45% OF
AMERICANS IDENTIFY AS

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:37.804
REPUBLICANS OR LEANING TOWARDS
REPUBLICANS 44% DEMOCRAT OR LEAN

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:39.806
IN THAT DIRECTION.
THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT SERVES

00:05:39.806 --> 00:05:44.877
THEM ALL AND ITS CREDIBILITY
RESTS ON BEING PERCEIVED TO PLAY

00:05:44.877 --> 00:05:47.480
FAIR.
YOU WROTE IN YOUR PIECE ONE OF

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:51.851
THE MOST SUPERFICIAL PARALLELS.
ONLY THE MOST SUPERFICIAL

00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:53.920
PARALLELS CAN BE DRAWN BETWEEN
THE TWO.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:59.725
I WONDER, DONALD, IF YOU THINK
IN THE EYES OF THE PUBLIC THESE

00:05:59.725 --> 00:06:02.895
CASES ARE INEXTRICABLY LINKED?
&gt;&gt; THAT'S WHY WE WROTE THE

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:07.200
ARTICLE WE WROTE, IS BECAUSE
IT'S CERTAINLY TRUE THAT WHEN

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:11.571
YOU HAVE TWO PRESIDENTS, ONE
CURRENT AND ONE PAST, WHO BOTH

00:06:11.571 --> 00:06:15.508
HAVE, YOU KNOW, IT'S FAIR TO SAY
THEIR TEAMS AND THEM PERHAPS

00:06:15.508 --> 00:06:20.146
HAVE MISHANDLED CLASSIFIED
DOCUMENTS.

00:06:20.146 --> 00:06:23.282
IT'S REALLY IMPORTANT TO
UNDERSTAND WHAT CONDUCT IS AT

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:26.352
ISSUE.
AND AS FAR AS WE KNOW NOW, AS

00:06:26.352 --> 00:06:32.625
YOU JUST ACCOUNTED, THE BIDEN
PEOPLE CLEARLY MADE A BLUNDER IN

00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:37.230
HAVING THESE DOCUMENTS TAKEN
AND -- TAKEN AWAY FROM THE WHITE

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.665
HOUSE.
THERE'S NO TWO WAYS ABOUT THAT,

00:06:39.665 --> 00:06:43.503
BUT IT APPEARS FROM WHAT WE SEE,
AND TIME WILL TELL IF IT'S TRUE.

00:06:43.503 --> 00:06:47.740
IT APPEARS THEY DON'T HAVE ANY
INTEREST IN CONCEALING THESE

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:50.409
DOCUMENTS THEY'RE NOT TRYING TO
KEEP THESE DOCUMENTS.

00:06:50.409 --> 00:06:54.247
THEY'RE AS EAGER AS ANYBODY TO
GET THEM BACK TO WHERE THEY

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:57.717
BELONG IN THE GOVERNMENT.
AND TRUMP'S TEAM, AND TRUMP

00:06:57.717 --> 00:07:02.688
HIMSELF, IT APPEARS FROM THE
EVIDENCE, HAVE ACTIVELY BEEN

00:07:02.688 --> 00:07:05.992
ENGAGED IN FIGURING OUT WAYS TO
NOT GIVE THEM BACK OVER A PERIOD

00:07:05.992 --> 00:07:11.831
OF MANY, MANY MONTHS.
IT'S THAT INTENTIONAL

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:14.333
CONCEALMENT AND OBSTRUCTION THAT
GIVES RISE TO CRIMINAL POSSIBLE

00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:16.035
PROSECUTION.
AND THAT'S THE KEY DIFFERENCE

00:07:16.035 --> 00:07:18.538
HERE.
SO I THINK WHAT'S IMPORTANT IS

00:07:18.538 --> 00:07:23.109
FOR THE PUBLIC TO TRY TO
UNDERSTAND, ESSENTIALLY, THE

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:29.916
CRITICAL DIFFERENCE, WHY IT
MATTERS TO HAVE A FORMER

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:31.751
PRESIDENT DELIBERATELY KEEPING
AND CONCEALING CLASSIFIED

00:07:31.751 --> 00:07:37.490
INFORMATION OF THE HIGHEST
SENSITIVITY, AND I THINK MERRICK

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:43.095
GARLAND, THE ATTORNEY GENERAL,
HAS ACTUALLY HANDLED IT QUITE

00:07:43.095 --> 00:07:46.999
WELL BY APPOINTING SPECIAL
COUNSELS.

00:07:46.999 --> 00:07:48.401
BECAUSE, CLEARLY, THERE ARE
PEOPLE OUT THERE WHO ARE GOING

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:51.203
TO SAY, EVEN THOUGH I DON'T
THINK IT'S FAIR, AND I DON'T

00:07:51.203 --> 00:07:53.573
THINK IT'S JUSTIFIED.
THERE ARE PEOPLE WHO ARE GOING

00:07:53.573 --> 00:07:56.809
TO SAY, OH, MERRICK GARLAND,
WORKS FOR JOE BIDEN, SO MERRICK

00:07:56.809 --> 00:08:00.846
GARLAND IS IN THE TANK AND HE'LL
DO WHATEVER JOE BIDEN WANTS.

00:08:00.846 --> 00:08:05.952
NOT TRUE.
BUT MUCH BETTER TO HAVE SOMEONE

00:08:05.952 --> 00:08:08.921
WHO'S ACTUALLY AN EXCELLENT
LAWYER BUT ALSO A TRUMP

00:08:08.921 --> 00:08:11.157
APPOINTEE LOOKING AT THE BIDEN
SITUATION.

00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:14.794
I THINK THAT'S WHERE WE ARE NOW
AND I HOPE PEOPLE CAN LEARN FROM

00:08:14.794 --> 00:08:17.096
IT.
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS REALLY BACK-TO-BACK

00:08:17.096 --> 00:08:20.299
AS IT PERTAINS TO THE BIDEN
DOCUMENTS MERRICK GARLAND WENT

00:08:20.299 --> 00:08:24.337
OUT OF HIS WAY TO MAKE SURE IT
WAS TRUMP APPOINTEES, FIRST OUT

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:27.974
OF CHICAGO AND NOW THE SPECIAL
COUNSEL, A TRUMP APPOINTEE AS

00:08:27.974 --> 00:08:30.977
WELL.
&gt;&gt; I WONDER, THE CHAIR OF THE

00:08:30.977 --> 00:08:35.514
HOUSE OVERSIGHT COMMITTEE, JAMES
COMER SAYS SUBPOENAS ARE ON THE

00:08:35.514 --> 00:08:37.650
TABLE FOR THE BIDEN WHITE HOUSE
IN THIS CASE.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:41.187
IF THAT HAPPENS, YOU WORKED IN
THIS WHITE HOUSE, YOU WORKED

00:08:41.187 --> 00:08:43.723
UNDER TWO REPUBLICAN
ADMINISTRATIONS BUT IF YOU

00:08:43.723 --> 00:08:46.892
WORKED IN THIS WHITE HOUSE, WHAT
WOULD YOUR ADVICE BE?

00:08:46.892 --> 00:08:51.964
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S CLEARLY
INAPPROPRIATE FOR CONGRESS TO BE

00:08:51.964 --> 00:08:55.768
INVESTIGATING AN ONGOING
INVESTIGATION -- AN ONGOING

00:08:55.768 --> 00:08:58.804
CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION.
THEY CAN LOOK AT IT AFTER IT

00:08:58.804 --> 00:09:00.973
OCCURS, BUT THEY DON'T HAVE ANY
RIGHT.

00:09:00.973 --> 00:09:05.778
IT'S REALLY A SEPARATION OF
POWERS VIOLATION, TO COME IN IN

00:09:05.778 --> 00:09:09.081
THE MIDDLE OF AN ONGOING
INVESTIGATION AND TRY TO DISRUPT

00:09:09.081 --> 00:09:12.384
IT BY -- I GUESS WHAT THEY WANT
TO DO IS MAKE PUBLIC WHAT'S

00:09:12.384 --> 00:09:16.789
GOING ON IN THE INVESTIGATION.
ONE OF THE VERY SACRED THINGS

00:09:16.789 --> 00:09:22.194
ABOUT OUR CRIMINAL PROCESS AND
THE INVESTIGATIVE PROCESS THAT

00:09:22.194 --> 00:09:24.863
THE DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE
ENGAGES IN IS THAT IT'S NOT

00:09:24.863 --> 00:09:30.936
SUPPOSED TO PUBLICALLY PILLAR
PEOPLE OR FACTS THAT ARE UNDER

00:09:30.936 --> 00:09:33.039
INVESTIGATION.
THE JOB IS TO INVESTIGATE,

00:09:33.039 --> 00:09:36.475
FIGURE OUT WHAT THE FACTS ARE,
FIGURE OUT IF THERE'S A CASE TO

00:09:36.475 --> 00:09:38.844
BE BROUGHT AND THEN BRING IT AND
TALK ABOUT IT.

00:09:38.844 --> 00:09:41.213
BUT YOU DON'T DO IT WHILE YOU'RE
INVESTIGATING.

00:09:41.213 --> 00:09:44.984
SO I THINK ONE WOULD RESIST THE
SUBPOENAS WITH REGARD TO THE

00:09:44.984 --> 00:09:47.219
ONGOING CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION.
&gt;&gt; SO YOU THINK McCARTHY IS

00:09:47.219 --> 00:09:50.489
WRONG WHEN HE SAID YESTERDAY ON
FOX NEWS THERE'S AN OBLIGATION

00:09:50.489 --> 00:09:56.195
FOR CONGRESS TO DO THIS NOW?
&gt;&gt; YEAH, WELL, I THINK CERTAINLY

00:09:56.195 --> 00:09:59.998
THEY HAVE A RIGHT TO DO
OVERSIGHT, CERTAINLY, OF WHAT

00:09:59.998 --> 00:10:02.735
THE EXECUTIVE BRANCH IS DOING.
BUT THEY DON'T HAVE A RIGHT TO

00:10:02.735 --> 00:10:06.272
GET INTO THE SPECIFICS OF AN
ONGOING CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION.

00:10:06.272 --> 00:10:10.209
I'M AFRAID WHAT WE'RE GOING TO
SEE IS, YOU KNOW, REALLY AN

00:10:10.209 --> 00:10:15.881
EFFORT THAT'S ENTIRELY AIMED --
TALK ABOUT POLITICIZATION.

00:10:15.881 --> 00:10:20.019
IT'S ENTIRELY AIMED AT TRYING TO
POLITICIZE THE SITUATION IN A

00:10:20.019 --> 00:10:23.456
WAY THEY BELIEVE WILL APPEAL TO
FAR RIGHT MAGA REPUBLICAN

00:10:23.456 --> 00:10:27.560
SUPPORTERS AND THEY WANT TO STIR
UP THAT POT AND IT'S REGRETTABLE

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:31.230
BECAUSE THIS COUNTRY DOESN'T
NEED TO HAVE CONTROVERSY AND

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:34.633
CONFLICT STIRRED UP ANY MORE AT
THIS POINT.

00:10:34.633 --> 00:10:36.902
&gt;&gt; DONALD AYERS THANK YOU FOR
TIME THIS MORNING.

